Package: readboj
Title: Auditable Access to Bank of Japan Statistics
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Chartwell", "Macro", email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves and searches official Bank of Japan statistical data
    while retaining exact source identity, raw response hashes, bilingual
    metadata, and bounded cache snapshots. Supports the Time-Series Data
    Search application programming interface, official bulk file catalogue,
    and dated Tankan comprehensive-data release assets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readboj
BugReports: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readboj/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    digest,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    readxl,
    readr,
    xml2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    writexl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
